## What this baseline does not measure

- Frame timing, legibility or any visual claim (no capture was taken; no window grab
  is possible on this Mac — `docs/wayfinder/evidence/local-macos-gate-sweep.md`).
- The two pack-content suites (`godot/build/**` is gitignored and absent); they are
  reported `not scored`, which is the port's own documented behaviour.
- Any macOS-window behaviour of the owner's running game window (PID 94690): it was
  observed alive, never inspected or driven.
